Port of _patches/typescript/015-ls-inlay-hints.patch (tsc/internal/ls/inlay_hints.go) to tsrs.

- AfterInlayHintsCallback, RegisterAfterInlayHintsCallback: `tsrs_ls::{AfterInlayHintsCallback,
  register_after_inlay_hints_callback}` (a `fn` in a process-wide `RwLock`; registering replaces the previous one).
  The program is the `&'static tsrs_compiler::Program` Go's `checker.Program` argument holds.
- ProvideInlayHint passes each projection's hints through it before appending them to the result.

